3415:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h **** /**
3416:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @brief  Helper macro to calculate the temperature (unit: degree Celsius)
3417:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         from ADC conversion data of internal temperature sensor.
3418:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   Computation is using temperature sensor calibration values
3419:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         stored in system memory for each device during production.
3420:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   Calculation formula:
3421:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           Temperature = ((TS_ADC_DATA - TS_CAL1)
3422:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *                           * (TS_CAL2_TEMP - TS_CAL1_TEMP))
3423:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *                         / (TS_CAL2 - TS_CAL1) + TS_CAL1_TEMP
3424:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           with TS_ADC_DATA = temperature sensor raw data measured by ADC
3425:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *                Avg_Slope = (TS_CAL2 - TS_CAL1)
3426:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *                            / (TS_CAL2_TEMP - TS_CAL1_TEMP)
3427:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *                TS_CAL1   = equivalent TS_ADC_DATA at temperature
3428:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *                            TEMP_DEGC_CAL1 (calibrated in factory)
3429:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *                TS_CAL2   = equivalent TS_ADC_DATA at temperature
3430:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *                            TEMP_DEGC_CAL2 (calibrated in factory)
3431:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         Caution: Calculation relevancy under reserve that calibration
3432:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *                  parameters are correct (address and data).
3433:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *                  To calculate temperature using temperature sensor
3434:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *                  datasheet typical values (generic values less, therefore
3435:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *                  less accurate than calibrated values),
3436:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *                  use helper macro @ref __LL_ADC_CALC_TEMPERATURE_TYP_PARAMS().
3437:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   As calculation input, the analog reference voltage (Vref+) must be
3438:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         defined as it impacts the ADC LSB equivalent voltage.
3439:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   Analog reference voltage (Vref+) must be either known from
3440:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         user board environment or can be calculated using ADC measurement
3441:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         and ADC helper macro @ref __LL_ADC_CALC_VREFANALOG_VOLTAGE().
3442:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   On this STM32 series, calibration data of temperature sensor
3443:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         corresponds to a resolution of 12 bits,
3444:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         this is the recommended ADC resolution to convert voltage of
3445:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         temperature sensor.
3446:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         Otherwise, this macro performs the processing to scale
3447:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         ADC conversion data to 12 bits.
3448:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @param  __VREFANALOG_VOLTAGE__  Analog reference voltage (unit: mV)
3449:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @param  __TEMPSENSOR_ADC_DATA__ ADC conversion data of internal
