1628:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****       (+) Enter ADC deep-power-down mode
1629:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c **** 
